{"title":"EV Arts Patronage Tranche","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/953736845/0/marginalrevolution~EV-Arts-Patronage-Tranche.html","date":1776101459000,"content":"<p><span>EV Arts Patronage Tranche</span></p>\r\n<p>This is a new tranche of ad hoc awards, given out more like prizes, without applications, to writers, creatives, and intellectuals who are not supported by the current system of awards and grants, or who have been failed by such systems.</p>\r\n<p>With the assistance of Henry Oliver.</p>\r\n<p>I am pleased to announce that our first winner is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/helendewitt\" target=\"_blank\">Helen DeWitt</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Please do contact me if you are interested in supporting this new effort.  Let us debureaucratize the arts!</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/04/ev-arts-patronage-tranche.html\">EV Arts Patronage Tranche</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/953736845/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/953736845/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/953736845/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/953736845/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/953736845/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/953736845/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.